{"id":"vod_sn_39091","vodId":"39091","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"亲吻姐姐","name_cn":"亲吻姐姐","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第12集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/383feb10bc9cbde6c8299bb41f079787.jpg"},"summary":"住之江圭太是个临近高中升学考试的初中三年级男生。他在小时候由于父亲再婚，而和可爱的双胞胎姐妹·亚香和理香成为了姐弟。尽管没有血缘关系，三人也关系和睦地一同成长，但不知从何时开始，亚香和理香却似乎对圭太产生了恋情。看似是个认真的人、实际上是闷骚类型的亚香，以及虽然说话很冷淡、内在却很积极的理香。被两人所逼近的圭太，陷入了并非是由于应考学习所导致的、另一种意义上的困境。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:07:13","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/Mj1MWvaRm81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/cncnsMPpcj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LwTSftaeH11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/u3hnfK8S8h1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/bmy8XnWW1t1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/mKMZhKvHpS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XL4BsYHgUx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/ArKPNqZEUU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/dvkcQB0U5m1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/xg0UvnTVBZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/MY4UyNHcb81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/Y6t5i8vdkj1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:50.704Z"}